# SPA fallback for hosts that support _redirects (Netlify-style).
# Prerendered files (/read/<id>/index.html, /topics/... etc.) already exist on
# disk and win over this rule; it only catches routes with no static file —
# chiefly /admin and shared speeches published to the cloud.
# 2.4 renamed the working rooms. Old links keep their ranking with a 301.
/practice       /rehearse   301
/practice/*     /rehearse/:splat   301
/studio         /write      301
/studio/*       /write/:splat      301
/web            /arrivals   301

